Dear Marcelo,

You may have a conflict with the function pulse() of tuneR.

You should be able to solve your issue with:

seewave::pulse(dbefore=0.5,dpulse=0.1,dafter=0.3,f=44100,plot=F)

The pulse() function of seewave will be renamed pulsew() in the forthcoming release.

Best regards,

Jerome

